{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_049_variational_network-title\">Variational Network</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">把多线圈 MRI 的变分梯度下降展开，并联合学习卷积滤波器、势函数与每级更新权重。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unrolls K steps of gradient descent on a generalized Fields-of-Experts variational energy for multi-coil MRI, jointly learning convolutional filters, non-linear potentials, and data weights.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">欠采样多线圈 k-space y、采样掩膜 P 与线圈灵敏度 S</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Undersampled multi-coil k-space data y, sampling mask P, and pre-estimated coil sensitivity maps S</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">K 次变分更新后的复数 MRI 图像 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Complex-valued reconstructed MRI image x^{(K)} after K unrolled variational steps</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.7</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29115689/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_049_variational_network')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_049_variational_network')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Variational Network original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/2aa3b9297a3d0de20177.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.7</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_049_variational_network\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_049_variational_network')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_049_variational_network\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多线圈 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-coil y</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">PFSx 加噪后的欠采样 k-space</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests undersampled multi-coil k-space data y, sampling mask p, and pre-estimated coil sensitivity maps s and prepares initial tensor representations (multi-coil y).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"PFSx 加噪后的欠采样 k-space\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests undersampled multi-coil k-space data y, sampling mask p, and pre-estimated coil sensitivity maps s and prepares initial tensor representations (multi-coil y).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多线圈 y\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-coil y\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多线圈 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-coil y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">PFSx 加噪后的欠采样 k-space</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests undersampled multi-coil k-space data y, sampling mask p, and pre-estimated coil sensitivity maps s and prepares initial tensor representations (multi-coil y).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"灵敏度调制、傅里叶变换与采样掩膜\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes A=PFS to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"A=PFS\" data-node-name-en=\"A=PFS\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A=PFS</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">灵敏度调制、傅里叶变换与采样掩膜</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes A=PFS to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"零填充逆 FFT 后做线圈组合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs A*=S*F*P* within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"A*=S*F*P*\" data-node-name-en=\"A*=S*F*P*\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A*=S*F*P*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">零填充逆 FFT 后做线圈组合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs A*=S*F*P* within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 A*y 初始化并在复数图像域更新\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x_k within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"图像 x_k\" data-node-name-en=\"x_k\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像 x_k</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x_k</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 A*y 初始化并在复数图像域更新</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x_k within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A*(A x_k-y)，把采样点残差带回图像域\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Data Fidelity Gradient within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"数据梯度\" data-node-name-en=\"Data Fidelity Gradient\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据梯度</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Data Fidelity Gradient</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A*(A x_k-y)，把采样点残差带回图像域</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Data Fidelity Gradient within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"K_i x_k 提取局部特征，K_i* 回传正则梯度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 06 within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"学习滤波器\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">学习滤波器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">K_i x_k 提取局部特征，K_i* 回传正则梯度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 06 within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"学习非线性 influence functions，替代手工正则项\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs phi within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"势函数 phi\" data-node-name-en=\"phi\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">势函数 phi</span><span class=\"lang-en\">phi</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">学习非线性 influence functions，替代手工正则项</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs phi within the core unrolled variational mri computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_{k+1}=x_k-dcgrad-ΣK_i*phi_i(K_i x_k)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Variational Update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"变分更新\" data-node-name-en=\"Variational Update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">变分更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Variational Update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_{k+1}=x_k-dcgrad-ΣK_i*phi_i(K_i x_k)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Variational Update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"K 个 stage 后的复数重建与幅度图\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces complex-valued reconstructed mri image x^{(k)} after k unrolled variational steps via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_049_variational_network', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">K 个 stage 后的复数重建与幅度图</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces complex-valued reconstructed mri image x^{(k)} after k unrolled variational steps via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Variational Network Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 学习正则梯度与多线圈数据梯度</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unrolled Variational Gradient Descent with Multi-Coil SENSE Forward Operator A and Adjoint A*</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Variational Network：核心公式 · 学习正则梯度与多线圈数据梯度\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria