<use x=\"23.980686\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-58\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"28.973288\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"32.838791\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-32\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"39.633304\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"42.400571\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-150\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"45.033296\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-58\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"49.527764\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"54.577329\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-58\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"59.071802\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"65.101344\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g10-0\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"73.521936\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-95\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"79.428283\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-58\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"84.669953\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-22\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"90.886628\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g7-3\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"95.308342\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"99.771599\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-22\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"105.988275\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"111.037839\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g13-58\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"117.746179\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g10-0\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"126.694786\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"131.496776\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"135.312452\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"150.282922\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-22\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"159.266931\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"168.659418\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-37\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"175.294521\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-27\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"182.228514\" xlink:href=\"#m049_g16-40\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">手工 regularizer 和 potential 表达能力有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Compressed-sensing MRI with fixed wavelet/TV regularizers reconstructed slowly and introduced staircasing or over-smoothing.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">展开变分梯度下降，学习滤波器、势函数并显式使用多线圈 forward model</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unfold K=10 gradient descent steps of a variational energy combining learned convolutional filter-bank potentials with exact multi-coil k-space data consistency.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">端到端学习每步 variational update 与数据项</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">End-to-end training of stage-specific filter kernels, spline activation derivatives (potentials), and data-consistency step weights.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在 accelerated MRI 中已有临床工作流速度和质量证据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">First unrolled MRI reconstruction architecture validated in clinical reader studies to achieve 4× accelerated knee MRI acquisition.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">unrolled MRI 的核心祖型；序列与厂商迁移仍有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational clinical unrolled MRI milestone; shallow Fields-of-Experts regularizers were later deepened into U-Net cascades in E2E-VarNet.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">从变分目标的梯度下降推导每一级，而不是把重建当作无结构的图像到图像回归。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">多线圈 forward model PFS 与伴随 S*F*P* 保证采样残差以正确几何进入更新。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">滤波器和势函数由数据学习，替代固定的稀疏先验，同时保持有限级可解释展开。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Unfold K=10 gradient descent steps of a variational energy combining learned convolutional filter-bank potentials with exact multi-coil k-space data consistency.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: End-to-end training of stage-specific filter kernels, spline activation derivatives (potentials), and data-consistency step weights.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Unrolled Variational Gradient Descent with Multi-Coil SENSE Forward Operator A and Adjoint A*.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适用于给定采样 mask 和可靠 coil maps 的加速多线圈 MRI，可把重建速度固定在 K 级前向。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">序列、场强、厂商或灵敏度估计改变时，学习到的正则与数据项权重可能失配。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: First unrolled MRI reconstruction architecture validated in clinical reader studies to achieve 4× accelerated knee MRI acquisition.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational clinical unrolled MRI milestone; shallow Fields-of-Experts regularizers were later deepened into U-Net cascades in E2E-VarNet.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29115689/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Learning a Variational Network for Reconstruction of Accelerated MRI Data</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/VLOGroup/mri-variationalnetwork\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
